SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 0.05

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05

MIX 1
    1 1
    2 1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

SAVE solution 1

INCREMENTAL_REACTIONS true
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_temp.sel
    -reset false
    -solution true
    -temperature true
    -molalities Ca+2 CaCO3 CaHCO3+ CaOH+ CaSO4 CaCl+
    -simulation true
    -step true
    -high_precision true

END